<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 341 0 R
/E (This project is a secure web-based Student Information System developed for the Secure Software Engineering course. The system allows students to securely log in and view their grades, while instructors can post and update grades.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
